peIndexOf(this._sessionCache.list\x2C key);\x0d\n  if (index === -1)\x0d\n    return;\x0d\n\x0d\n  ArrayPrototypeSplice(this._sessionCache.list\x2C index\x2C 1);\x0d\n  delete this._sessionCache.map[key];\x0d\n};\x0d\n\x0d\nconst globalAgent = new Agent();\x0d\n\x0d\n/**\x0d\n * Makes a request to a secure web server.\x0d\n * @param {...any} args\x0d\n * @returns {ClientRequest}\x0d\n */\x0d\nfunction request(...args) {\x0d\n  let options = {};\x0d\n\x0d\n  if (typeof args[0] === 'string') {\x0d\n    const urlStr = ArrayPrototypeShift(args);\x0d\n    options = urlToHttpOptions(new URL(urlStr));\x0d\n  } else if (args[0] && args[0][searchParamsSymbol] &&\x0d\n             args[0][searchParamsSymbol][searchParamsSymbol]) {\x0d\n    // url.URL instance\x0d\n    options = urlToHttpOptions(ArrayPrototypeShift(args));\x0d\n  }\x0d\n\x0d\n  if (args[0] && typeof args[0] !== 'function') {\x0d\n    ObjectAssign(options\x2C ArrayPrototypeShift(args));\x0d\n  }\x0d\n\x0d\n  options._defaultAgent = module.exports.globalAgent;\x0d\n  ArrayPrototypeUnshift(args\x2C options);\x0d\n\x0d\n  return ReflectConstruct(ClientRequest\x2C args);\x0d\n}\x0d\n\x0d\n/**\x0d\n * Makes a GET request to a secure web server.\x0d\n * @param {string | URL} input\x0d\n * @param {{\x0d\n *   agent?: Agent | boolean;\x0d\n *   auth?: string;\x0d\n *   createConnection?: Function;\x0d\n *   defaultPort?: number;\x0d\n *   family?: number;\x0d\n *   headers?: Object;\x0d\n *   hints?: number;\x0d\n *   host?: string;\x0d\n *   hostname?: string;\x0d\n *   insecureHTTPParser?: boolean;\x0d\n *   localAddress?: string;\x0d\n *   localPort?: number;\x0d\n *   lookup?: Function;\x0d\n *   maxHeaderSize?: number;\x0d\n *   method?: string;\x0d\n *   path?: string;\x0d\n *   port?: number;\x0d\n *   protocol?: string;\x0d\n *   setHost?: boolean;\x0d\n *   socketPath?: string;\x0d\n *   timeout?: number;\x0d\n *   signal?: AbortSignal;\x0d\n *   } | string | URL} [options]\x0d\n * @param {Function} [cb]\x0d\n